            "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;700;900&family=Open+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');\n\n  :root {\n    --unicef-blue: #1CABE2;\n    --unicef-dark-blue: #0083A9;\n    --warm-amber: #FFB81C;\n    --warm-orange: #F26A21;\n    --text-dark: #2D2D2D;\n    --text-light: #F5F5F5;\n  }\n  \n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  \n  body {\n    width: 2384px;\n    height: 3370px;\n    font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif;\n    background-color: var(--unicef-blue);\n    color: var(--text-light);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    position: relative;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, var(--unicef-blue) 0%, #005a75 100%);\n  }\n  \n  /* Abstract Shapes / Background */\n  .bg-shape-1 {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -15%; left: -10%;\n    width: 1200px; height: 1200px;\n    background: var(--unicef-dark-blue);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    opacity: 0.6;\n    z-index: 0;\n    filter: blur(100px);\n  }\n  .bg-shape-2 {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: -15%; right: -10%;\n    width: 1800px; height: 1800px;\n    background: var(--warm-orange);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    opacity: 0.4;\n    z-index: 0;\n    filter: blur(150px);\n  }\n  .bg-shape-3 {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 35%; left: 60%;\n    width: 800px; height: 800px;\n    background: var(--warm-amber);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    opacity: 0.5;\n    z-index: 0;\n    filter: blur(120px);\n  }\n\n  .content-wrapper {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 10;\n    padding: 150px 180px;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n\n  /* Header */\n  .header {\n    text-align: left;\n    margin-bottom: 80px;\n    border-left: 20px solid var(--warm-amber);\n    padding-left: 50px;\n  }\n  .header h1 {\n    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 140px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    color: white;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    text-shadow: 4px 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n  .header .one-liner {\n    font-size: 54px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #FFF;\n    max-width: 1900px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n  }\n\n  /* Core Message - Huge Number */\n  .hero-stat {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 0%, rgba(240,240,240,0.95) 100%);\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    padding: 80px 100px;\n    box-shadow: 0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n    text-align: center;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    margin-bottom: 100px;\n    border-top: 20px solid var(--warm-orange);\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .hero-stat::before {\n    content: '\"';\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -20px; left: 40px;\n    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 300px;\n    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n  }\n  .hero-stat h2 {\n    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 320px;\n    color: var(--unicef-dark-blue);\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n    letter-spacing: -8px;\n    text-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--warm-amber);\n  }\n  .hero-stat p {\n    font-size: 64px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  \n  /* Main Columns */\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 80px;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  \n  .col {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 80px;\n  }\n  \n  /* Cards */\n  .card {\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n    padding: 70px;\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    backdrop-filter: blur(15px);\n    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n  }\n  .card h3 {\n    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 72px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin-bottom: 50px;\n    color: var(--warm-amber);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  \n  /* Stats Grid */\n  .stats-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 50px;\n  }\n  .stat-box {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    padding: 50px;\n    border-radius: 25px;\n    border-left: 12px solid var(--warm-amber);\n  }\n  .stat-val {\n    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 96px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: white;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .stat-label {\n    font-size: 34px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);\n  }\n\n  /* Lists */\n  ul {\n    list-style: none;\n  }\n  ul li {\n    font-size: 42px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-bottom: 35px;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 70px;\n  }\n  ul li::before {\n    content: \"■\";\n    color: var(--warm-orange);\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 6px;\n    font-size: 48px;\n  }\n  ul li strong {\n    color: var(--warm-amber);\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .focus-list li {\n    font-size: 38px;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n    padding-left: 60px;\n  }\n  .focus-list li::before {\n    content: \"▶\";\n    color: var(--unicef-blue);\n    font-size: 38px;\n    top: 8px;\n  }\n\n  /* Call to Action */\n  .cta {\n    background: var(--text-dark);\n    padding: 80px 100px;\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 80px;\n    border: 6px solid var(--warm-amber);\n    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .cta::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n    background: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255,184,28,0.1) 50%, transparent 60%);\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n  .cta h2 {\n    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 80px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: var(--warm-amber);\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n  .cta p {\n    font-size: 48px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: white;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n  \n  /* Logos or Footer marks */\n  .footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-top: auto;\n    padding-top: 50px;\n    border-top: 3px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\n  }\n  .footer-text {\n    font-size: 36px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .unicef-logo {\n    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 80px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    color: white;\n  }\n  .unicef-logo span {\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--warm-amber);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"bg-shape-1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"bg-shape-2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"bg-shape-3\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n    \n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <h1>Every Child Deserves to Learn</h1>\n      <p class=\"one-liner\">Millions of children worldwide are still denied their right to quality education &mdash; UNICEF is working to change that.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-stat\">\n      <h2>250 MILLION</h2>\n      <p>Children and adolescents are out of school globally</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"columns\">\n      \n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"card\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\n          <h3>The Scale of the Crisis</h3>\n          <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n            <div class=\"stat-box\">\n              <div class=\"stat-val\">70%</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-label\">of children in low/middle-income countries unable to read by age 10</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-box\" style=\"border-left-color: var(--warm-orange);\">\n              <div class=\"stat-val\">2.5&times;</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-label\">more likely for girls to be excluded in crisis settings</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-box\">\n              <div class=\"stat-val\">~49%</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-label\">of children with disabilities out of school in low-income countries</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-box\" style=\"border-left-color: var(--warm-orange);\">\n              <div class=\"stat-val\">190+</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-label\">countries where UNICEF operates education programmes</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <h3>Barriers to Education</h3>\n          <ul>\n            <li><strong>Armed Conflict:</strong> Schools destroyed, teachers displaced.</li>\n            <li><strong>Poverty:</strong> Families cannot afford fees, relying on child labour.</li>\n            <li><strong>Gender Inequality:</strong> Deep-rooted social norms limiting girls' access.</li>\n            <li><strong>Disability:</strong> Exclusion from accessible classrooms.</li>\n            <li><strong>Climate Change:</strong> Environmental shocks disrupting schooling.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"card\" style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); color: var(--text-dark);\">\n          <h3 style=\"color: var(--unicef-dark-blue);\">UNICEF's Focus Areas</h3>\n          <ul class=\"focus-list\" style=\"color: var(--text-dark);\">\n            <li>Early childhood development &amp; readiness</li>\n            <li>Inclusive education for marginalized groups</li>\n            <li>Gender equality to keep girls in school</li>\n            <li>Education continuity in emergencies</li>\n            <li>Digital and innovative learning access</li>\n            <li>Adolescent skills for lifelong learning</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cta\">\n      <h2>What Can Be Done?</h2>\n      <p>Every child missing out on education is a missed opportunity for a healthier, more prosperous world. Investing in education means investing in peace and sustainable development. Together, we can ensure no child is left behind.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <div class=\"footer-text\">Aligned with Sustainable Development Goal 4 (SDG 4)</div>\n      <div class=\"unicef-logo\">UNICEF <span>|</span> EDUCATION</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
